1
00:00:46,039 --> 00:00:47,600
If that still doesn't work,

2
00:00:47,600 --> 00:00:49,439
I still have the Mei Family's Celestial Seal.

3
00:00:50,439 --> 00:00:51,240
Rat!

4
00:00:52,640 --> 00:00:53,439
Rat!

5
00:01:01,159 --> 00:01:01,920
That's enough, Young Master.

6
00:01:01,920 --> 00:01:02,960
Don't waste your breath.

7
00:01:02,960 --> 00:01:03,600
These two are as stubborn

8
00:01:03,600 --> 00:01:05,599
as a Jiangshi that's been in a coffin

9
00:01:06,680 --> 00:01:07,519
for ten thousand years.

10
00:01:19,719 --> 00:01:20,680
It's you.

11
00:01:21,439 --> 00:01:22,560
The one in the coffin.

12
00:01:23,079 --> 00:01:24,719
Young Master, it's one thing to touch their seal,

13
00:01:24,719 --> 00:01:27,200
but why did you have to disturb the person in the coffin too?

14
00:01:28,719 --> 00:01:31,120
When you trespassed into the Mei Family's secret room earlier,

15
00:01:31,879 --> 00:01:32,879
I was fully aware.

16
00:01:33,760 --> 00:01:35,519
The reason I hid in the coffin

17
00:01:36,040 --> 00:01:38,040
was to hear exactly what you were up to.

18
00:01:38,760 --> 00:01:43,079
It seems the Sheng Family really got a fine live-in son-in-law.

19
00:01:45,000 --> 00:01:46,000
Return it to its rightful owner.

20
00:01:49,640 --> 00:01:50,640
Miss Mei,

21
00:01:51,040 --> 00:01:54,120
borrowing the seal was indeed a bit offensive.

22
00:01:54,280 --> 00:01:56,799
But right now, I can't comply.

23
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:00,799
Fine.

24
00:02:01,519 --> 00:02:03,200
You can keep the Celestial Seal.

25
00:02:05,280 --> 00:02:06,079
On one condition.

26
00:02:09,000 --> 00:02:10,560
You become a live-in son-in-law to the Mei Family as well,

27
00:02:11,719 --> 00:02:12,759
and be my husband.

28
00:02:13,000 --> 00:02:14,800
Isn't that just Selling oneself?

29
00:02:17,400 --> 00:02:18,159
You're

30
00:02:18,599 --> 00:02:19,759
after

31
00:02:21,680 --> 00:02:23,319
my fate constitution, aren't you?

32
00:02:23,319 --> 00:02:27,439
You want me on the Mei Family's way to the Tidal Tomb,

33
00:02:27,439 --> 00:02:28,719
to shield you from disasters.

34
00:02:29,960 --> 00:02:31,439
And what if I refuse?

35
00:02:31,879 --> 00:02:33,240
If you refuse?

36
00:02:35,840 --> 00:02:37,400
You won't walk out of this alley.

37
00:02:38,360 --> 00:02:39,479
Then I accept.

38
00:02:39,479 --> 00:02:40,800
I accept it.

39
00:02:43,960 --> 00:02:44,639
Alright, let him go.

40
00:02:44,639 --> 00:02:45,319
He's one of us now.

41
00:02:50,919 --> 00:02:51,560
Dad,

42
00:02:51,840 --> 00:02:53,439
the full moon is approaching.

43
00:02:53,960 --> 00:02:55,919
The Sheng Family is currently Leaderless.

44
00:02:55,919 --> 00:02:56,560
As for our Qi Family,

45
00:02:56,560 --> 00:02:57,879
as their long-standing family allies,

46
00:02:57,879 --> 00:02:59,280
shouldn't we go and help them?

47
00:02:59,360 --> 00:03:00,159
Help?

48
00:03:00,319 --> 00:03:02,039
Of course we must help them.

49
00:03:02,039 --> 00:03:03,360
But how exactly we help,

50
00:03:03,879 --> 00:03:05,000
that requires tact.

51
00:03:05,280 --> 00:03:08,280
I'm organizing a Sheng Family friends and family care team.

52
00:03:08,319 --> 00:03:09,639
Our people will step forward

53
00:03:09,639 --> 00:03:11,120
to help them stabilize the situation.

54
00:03:11,960 --> 00:03:13,120
Oh, right.

55
00:03:13,159 --> 00:03:15,680
Especially in places like the storehouse

56
00:03:15,680 --> 00:03:18,000
and the accounting room,

57
00:03:18,000 --> 00:03:19,680
we must deploy extra manpower

58
00:03:19,680 --> 00:03:20,960
to focus on protecting them

59
00:03:20,960 --> 00:03:22,479
and pay extra attention.

60
00:03:22,680 --> 00:03:24,479
Don't worry, Dad. I promise

61
00:03:24,479 --> 00:03:27,800
our care team will act Like a spring breeze and rain,

62
00:03:27,800 --> 00:03:29,879
silently getting the job done.

63
00:03:29,879 --> 00:03:33,319
I guarantee the Sheng Family will be Moved to tears.

64
00:03:34,520 --> 00:03:35,680
The boy is worth teaching.

65
00:03:37,560 --> 00:03:38,360
Young Master,

66
00:03:38,840 --> 00:03:40,319
there's something I don't understand.

67
00:03:40,479 --> 00:03:42,879
Why did Miss Mei insist on you being a live-in son-in-law?

68
00:03:42,879 --> 00:03:43,680
What does she see in you?

69
00:03:43,680 --> 00:03:44,560
What does she want from you?

70
00:03:44,639 --> 00:03:46,479
Or does she think you're an experienced live-in son-in-law?

71
00:03:46,479 --> 00:03:47,719
Didn't you agree to it?

72
00:03:49,680 --> 00:03:50,719
If I didn't agree,

73
00:03:50,719 --> 00:03:53,199
we'd be just like that Puppet Corpse.

74
00:03:53,199 --> 00:03:53,840
Let's go.

75
00:03:53,840 --> 00:03:55,599
Let's play along with the Qi Family's little show first.

76
00:03:56,360 --> 00:03:57,159
Tiankun,

77
00:03:57,879 --> 00:03:59,520
we're going there to help.

78
00:04:00,319 --> 00:04:02,560
Remember to keep it dignified.

79
00:04:02,560 --> 00:04:03,639
Understood, Dad.

80
00:04:06,639 --> 00:04:07,639
Zhang Tianyou.

81
00:04:08,080 --> 00:04:09,639
How bold of you.

82
00:04:09,960 --> 00:04:11,639
I was just looking for you,

83
00:04:11,800 --> 00:04:13,080
and here you are delivering yourself to my door.

84
00:04:13,080 --> 00:04:14,360
Dad, let me kill him.

85
00:04:14,719 --> 00:04:15,439
Don't be hasty.

86
00:04:16,920 --> 00:04:17,680
I'm

87
00:04:17,920 --> 00:04:19,480
here to apologize.

88
00:04:20,639 --> 00:04:23,800
Eldest Young Master Qi kept climbing my wall for no reason,

89
00:04:23,800 --> 00:04:26,040
and ended up injuring his leg...

90
00:04:27,199 --> 00:04:28,879
I'm deeply sorry for that.

91
00:04:28,879 --> 00:04:31,160
Can you afford to compensate for my son's leg?

92
00:04:32,279 --> 00:04:33,759
I'd like to see

93
00:04:34,399 --> 00:04:36,000
what you'll use to compensate.

94
00:04:40,279 --> 00:04:41,480
With this.

95
00:04:42,439 --> 00:04:44,399
There's a prescription in the Earth Vein Sutra.

96
00:04:44,519 --> 00:04:47,279
It's said to cure Eldest Young Master Qi's leg,

97
00:04:47,279 --> 00:04:50,040
letting him experience the feeling of walking on solid ground again.

98
00:04:54,959 --> 00:04:55,759
Don't be impulsive.

99
00:05:00,439 --> 00:05:02,399
Let's talk about your terms.

100
00:05:06,560 --> 00:05:08,240
The Sheng Family's territory is too small.

101
00:05:08,240 --> 00:05:09,199
It's shabby.

102
00:05:09,519 --> 00:05:10,279
I want

103
00:05:11,040 --> 00:05:11,959
this piece.

104
00:05:12,759 --> 00:05:14,319
Dad, he's crazy!

105
00:05:15,800 --> 00:05:16,839
Fine.

106
00:05:20,360 --> 00:05:21,680
Prepare the contract.

107
00:05:51,800 --> 00:05:52,480
Thank you.

108
00:05:52,839 --> 00:05:53,600
I'll take my leave.

109
00:05:54,120 --> 00:05:54,920
Let's go.

110
00:05:55,519 --> 00:05:56,319
Guards!

111
00:06:01,040 --> 00:06:03,439
Master Qi, you're pulling a double-cross?

112
00:06:03,439 --> 00:06:04,519
Trying that with me?

113
00:06:04,519 --> 00:06:05,839
You're still too green.

114
00:06:15,839 --> 00:06:17,639
You think I scare that easily?

115
00:06:17,879 --> 00:06:20,040
You really think that's dynamite?

116
00:06:20,360 --> 00:06:21,279
Get them!

117
00:06:49,399 --> 00:06:51,199
Dad, are you okay?

118
00:06:51,319 --> 00:06:52,639
Illusion technique.

119
00:06:53,079 --> 00:06:55,000
This kid actually has some Spiritual Power.

120
00:06:55,879 --> 00:06:57,560
I still underestimated him.

121
00:06:58,399 --> 00:07:00,079
With our two families fighting,

122
00:07:00,079 --> 00:07:03,680
I was afraid the Wan Family and Mei Family would interfere.

123
00:07:04,399 --> 00:07:06,759
Since this kid has a death wish,

124
00:07:06,759 --> 00:07:08,279
no one can save him.

125
00:07:08,879 --> 00:07:11,160
We can't let him die at the Qi Family,

126
00:07:11,399 --> 00:07:13,240
nor can we let him die at the Sheng Family.

127
00:07:14,560 --> 00:07:16,639
Dad, then where should he die?

128
00:07:16,839 --> 00:07:17,959
Out on the road.

129
00:07:18,079 --> 00:07:18,720
Go now.

130
00:07:18,720 --> 00:07:20,360
Understood. I'll go right now.

131
00:07:21,639 --> 00:07:23,360
How did I raise such an idiot?

132
00:07:24,600 --> 00:07:25,519
Wait, Young Master.

133
00:07:25,800 --> 00:07:26,839
Did you really give it to him?

134
00:07:27,199 --> 00:07:27,639
No.

135
00:07:27,879 --> 00:07:29,120
There they are. Catch them!

136
00:07:29,120 --> 00:07:29,800
Let's go.

137
00:07:35,720 --> 00:07:36,519
Over there!

138
00:07:46,160 --> 00:07:48,600
Second Young Master, I found them!

139
00:07:49,639 --> 00:07:50,959
Those two idiots.

140
00:07:56,399 --> 00:07:57,480
A bunch of trash.

141
00:07:57,600 --> 00:07:58,560
Why aren't you attacking?

142
00:08:04,240 --> 00:08:06,000
Look at you cowards.

143
00:08:06,319 --> 00:08:07,160
Give me the blade.

144
00:08:11,560 --> 00:08:12,680
Why is there no blood?

145
00:08:13,800 --> 00:08:14,720
What are you?

146
00:08:14,720 --> 00:08:16,079
Qi the Second.

147
00:08:27,639 --> 00:08:28,920
You were willing to see me,

148
00:08:29,040 --> 00:08:30,560
which means you agreed.

149
00:08:34,279 --> 00:08:35,080
Yeah.

150
00:08:37,440 --> 00:08:38,240
Qi Tiankun.

151
00:08:38,240 --> 00:08:40,000
And who's this beauty?

152
00:08:40,039 --> 00:08:41,480
Where did she pop up from?

153
00:08:42,600 --> 00:08:44,600
Don't you dare touch the Mei Family's new Young Master!

154
00:09:04,000 --> 00:09:04,720
Let's fall back!

155
00:09:05,240 --> 00:09:06,120
Zhang Tianyou!

156
00:09:06,240 --> 00:09:07,679
You just wait!

157
00:09:08,279 --> 00:09:09,279
Come on, get back here!

158
00:09:09,279 --> 00:09:10,080
Come here.

159
00:09:12,559 --> 00:09:14,159
Don't they need to see a doctor?

160
00:09:14,440 --> 00:09:15,559
They're perfectly fine!

161
00:09:18,320 --> 00:09:18,879
Father.

162
00:09:18,879 --> 00:09:19,960
What are you doing?

163
00:09:20,360 --> 00:09:21,360
Don't worry, Tianting.

164
00:09:21,360 --> 00:09:22,879
With our Qi Family's Talisman Book,

165
00:09:22,879 --> 00:09:24,399
and the Sheng Family's Sutra,

166
00:09:24,519 --> 00:09:26,440
I will definitely heal your legs.

167
00:09:27,360 --> 00:09:28,240
Will this really work?

168
00:09:28,240 --> 00:09:29,559
It definitely will!

169
00:09:43,320 --> 00:09:45,759
How's it going, son? Feeling it now?

170
00:09:46,159 --> 00:09:46,759
Dad.

171
00:09:47,600 --> 00:09:48,159
Dad...

172
00:09:50,399 --> 00:09:51,480
I don't feel anything.

173
00:09:53,960 --> 00:09:55,000
That's impossible.

174
00:09:55,440 --> 00:09:57,919
Which step went wrong?

175
00:09:58,120 --> 00:09:59,639
Why don't you check again?

176
00:10:04,399 --> 00:10:05,080
Son.

177
00:10:05,519 --> 00:10:06,799
I skipped a verse.

178
00:10:06,799 --> 00:10:07,639
Sorry about that.

179
00:10:07,639 --> 00:10:09,480
I'll do it again right now.

180
00:10:09,480 --> 00:10:10,399
It'll definitely work.

181
00:10:11,080 --> 00:10:13,279
We, The Four Great Families, have already agreed

182
00:10:13,840 --> 00:10:15,879
to choose a Dragon-Seeking Champion

183
00:10:15,960 --> 00:10:18,000
to lead us back to the Tidal Tomb from twenty years ago,

184
00:10:18,080 --> 00:10:20,600
to eliminate the root cause that's plagued us for over twenty years.

185
00:10:21,559 --> 00:10:22,960
But this Champion

186
00:10:24,279 --> 00:10:25,799
must be an outsider,

187
00:10:25,799 --> 00:10:27,840
and must possess a special fate constitution.

188
00:10:28,759 --> 00:10:30,000
Originally, my Mei Family

189
00:10:30,120 --> 00:10:31,200
had already chosen someone for me:

190
00:10:31,200 --> 00:10:32,840
a Yin-hour born with a strong enough fate constitution.

191
00:10:33,840 --> 00:10:34,639
Who?

192
00:10:35,159 --> 00:10:35,960
Li Xiao.

193
00:10:36,679 --> 00:10:39,240
The son of the warlord Marshal Li.

194
00:10:39,919 --> 00:10:42,039
My Mei Family originally wanted to use their influence

195
00:10:42,159 --> 00:10:42,960
to retire from the underworld

196
00:10:42,960 --> 00:10:44,159
and go legitimate.

197
00:10:45,399 --> 00:10:47,279
I was actually ready to accept my fate.

198
00:10:47,600 --> 00:10:48,840
But then I found out

199
00:10:49,080 --> 00:10:51,360
that while Li Xiao was arranging our marriage,

200
00:10:51,759 --> 00:10:54,840
he was having a clandestine affair with Miss Wan Chun'er of the Wan Family.

201
00:10:56,960 --> 00:10:59,120
He thought I was some clay Buddha in a temple,

202
00:10:59,519 --> 00:11:00,360
without any temper.

203
00:11:00,360 --> 00:11:04,519
So you found me, the live-in son-in-law of the Sheng Family,

204
00:11:05,159 --> 00:11:06,360
to act as a shield.

205
00:11:06,679 --> 00:11:07,639
Just to spite him.

206
00:11:07,639 --> 00:11:08,919
Well, you can't exactly put it that way.

207
00:11:09,840 --> 00:11:13,200
It's just that someone has to fill this position.

208
00:11:13,559 --> 00:11:15,679
As for whether it's a pig or a dog,

209
00:11:15,679 --> 00:11:16,840
as long as it's not Li Xiao,

210
00:11:16,840 --> 00:11:18,279
I can probably tolerate it.

211
00:11:20,480 --> 00:11:21,159
Miss Mei,

212
00:11:21,159 --> 00:11:22,759
your way of complimenting people

213
00:11:23,159 --> 00:11:24,600
is really quite unique.

214
00:11:25,120 --> 00:11:26,080
You flatter me.

215
00:11:28,720 --> 00:11:30,200
The Celestial Seal is already in your hands.

216
00:11:30,279 --> 00:11:32,759
I hope my desperate act of grasping at straws

217
00:11:33,519 --> 00:11:34,320
wasn't misplaced.

218
00:11:35,200 --> 00:11:37,080
Becoming the Champion of the four families

219
00:11:37,080 --> 00:11:39,480
and gathering the Talisman, Curse, Seal, and Eye is only the first step.

220
00:11:39,679 --> 00:11:42,840
I will personally find that tomb and destroy it.

221
00:11:44,759 --> 00:11:47,279
But the ones who could use the Dragon-Seeking Formula

222
00:11:47,399 --> 00:11:50,320
to find the Tidal Tomb, the Dragon-Seeking Zhang Family,

223
00:11:50,559 --> 00:11:52,879
disappeared over twenty years ago.

224
00:11:53,519 --> 00:11:54,919
You only have a Dragon-Seeking Ruler.

225
00:11:55,480 --> 00:11:56,200
Will that be enough?

226
00:11:56,200 --> 00:11:57,960
That's my business.

227
00:12:01,840 --> 00:12:03,039
Zhang Tianyou.

228
00:12:03,840 --> 00:12:05,559
Who exactly are you?

229
00:12:36,840 --> 00:12:37,679
Dad!

230
00:12:45,799 --> 00:12:47,120
How is it, son?

231
00:12:47,120 --> 00:12:48,000
You feel it, right?

232
00:12:52,440 --> 00:12:53,080
Master.

233
00:12:53,080 --> 00:12:54,480
This... This feels like...

234
00:12:55,200 --> 00:12:56,200
Take a look!

235
00:12:56,200 --> 00:12:56,759
Dad!

236
00:12:57,000 --> 00:12:57,960
How is it, Dad?

237
00:12:59,879 --> 00:13:00,720
Tianting.

238
00:13:00,720 --> 00:13:02,080
Why are you fooling around?

239
00:13:02,080 --> 00:13:03,159
Why did you put your hand down here?

240
00:13:03,159 --> 00:13:04,279
I grabbed the wrong hand.

241
00:13:04,480 --> 00:13:05,720
My hand isn't down there.
